{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28241","headline":"长安即事寄友人 · 李远","name":"长安即事寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绮陌千年思断蓬，今来还宿凤城东。\n瑶台钟鼓长依旧，巫峡烟花自不同。\n千结故心爲怨网，万条新景作愁笼。\n何时更伴刘郎去，却见夭桃满树红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}